WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.368
Body cam video

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.403
just released a few moments ago

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.772
was very revealing and disturbing

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:08.875
Yeah, well,

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.410
police leadership said it's easy

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.879
to tell an officer to run toward gunfire.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.447
It's harder to actually do it.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:15.582
And that's what we saw

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.684
unfold on this body camera. Video.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.651
It's from the perspective

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.387
of two of the responding officers,

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:22.422
one of whom is still recovering

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.523
in the hospital

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.226
in critical condition after being shot.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:28.461
And this video picks up

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.096
after police actually

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.765
arrive here as they arrive,

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.633
but after those inside

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:34.801
had already been shot,

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.336
some of them killed.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:37.670
A warning to our viewers,

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.172
some of what you're about to see

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.640
may be considered graphic.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.307
Be

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:45.512
on the job.

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.179
New body

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:47.447
camera video shown

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.849
for the first time tonight

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:52.986
detailing the moments

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.654
police encountered the gunman

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.723
at Old National Bank in Louisville.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.290
This shooting

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.024
straight to these

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.459
when police arrived

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.293
just minutes

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.261
after the first nine

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.529
11, one call went out

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:03.763
almost immediately,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:05.065
engaging in a gunfight

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:05.765
and eventually

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.267
killing the shooter

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.669
says federal duty officer was

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.406
Officials say the

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:14.707
shooting inside the bank

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:15.575
that only lasted

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.011
a minute was still able to take lives

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.179
and injure others.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.947
This awful act of violence

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:23.083
at Old National yesterday

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.418
has taken another life.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:26.286
Late yesterday,

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.922
we learned that Deanna Eckert passed

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.759
she was 57 years old.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.295
She was an employee of Old National Bank

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:36.763
police revealing

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:37.597
the air style

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.165
rifle used was purchased

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.434
less than a week before the attack.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.304
He purchased the weapon used in this

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.239
tragic incident on yesterday

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.441
on April the fourth.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.877
He purchased the weapon legally

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:54.080
from one of the local dealerships

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.415
here in Louisville.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:56.883
Authorities continue

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.084
to search for a motive.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.085
We're just trying to piece

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.320
everything together,

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.321
conducting a search

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:02.655
of the gunman's residence,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.657
not yet revealing what was recovered,

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:06.392
but acknowledging a note left

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.528
by the shooter warning of his attack.

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:11.030
One of those warnings reported to police.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.465
25 year old white male Connor

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.000
Sturgeon, 64.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.202
He's texted a friend,

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:17.804
called a friend with a voicemail.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.705
He's going to kill everyone.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.940
At the bank feeling suicidal.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.542
Now, officials in Louisville

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.744
prepare for an evening vigil Wednesday.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.480
We are heartbroken.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.282
We are despondent.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.285
Their message Tuesday was clear.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.921
Responding to these mass shootings

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.756
is taking too heavy at all.

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:39.225
It's more than tired. I'm weary.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.860
There's only so many times

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.962
you can walk into a room

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:43.830
and tell someone

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.232
they're not coming home tomorrow.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.234
And it just breaks your heart

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.502
when you hear someone screaming

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.172
Mommy or daddy.

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:55.108
It just becomes too hard

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.679
And as of now, we still do

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.580
have at least three

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.581
people still recovering

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.415
in the hospital, one

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.184
remaining in critical condition

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.251
in regards to the video

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.419
One of the difficult things

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.254
that the deputy police chief described

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.155
was that the angle

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:10.356
that the officers were seeing,

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.758
because it was dark inside

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:12.859
and light outside,

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.261
they actually could not see inside

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:16.396
that lobby.

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:17.730
But the person inside the lobby,

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.032
the shooter, could see them

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.800
making it incredibly difficult.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.902
But as the deputy police chief outlined,

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.103
the most heroic things

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:24.671
that we do

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:25.305
as officers

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.373
are shrouded in people's tragedies.

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:28.575
And I think there's no

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.310
exception here, Wolf. Certainly not.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:30.677
All right.

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.412
Omar Jimenez, thank you very much.

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:34.013
Joining us now from Louisville,

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.515
the mayor, Craig Greenburg.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:37.350
He was just at that news conference

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:37.650
as well.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.418
Mayor Greenburg,

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:39.786
thank you so much for joining us.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.120
I know you had a chance

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:41.688
to review

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:42.222
this body

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:43.389
camera footage

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.458
before it was publicly released.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.727
What stands out to you as you watch

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.195
this very disturbing video

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.700
Two things stand out well.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.468
First of all, the bravery

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:57.670
and the heroic nature of officers

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.907
Will Galloway to run to the scene

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.342
knowing that there was a gunman,

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:04.177
not knowing what was behind the glass,

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:04.978
as you just heard,

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:06.946
not being able to see above them

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.048
or through the glass.

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.917
And they continued even after Officer

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:11.985
Wolfe was shot.

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:12.885
Officer Galloway

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.354
remained in a position

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:15.722
where he could take care

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:16.656
of the situation.

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:18.925
And once the officers arrived on scene,

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:19.659
no further

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:22.862
injuries or deaths occurred as a result.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.397
So the officers truly

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.532
were able to save lives.

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.401
And so I'm very thankful for that.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:29.269
And secondly,

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:32.972
just a heartbreaking tragedy to see that,

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:35.708
to see some of the other footage

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.410
of the victims

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.811
that have been

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.980
impacted with injuries or worse,

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.315
five of our neighbors

00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:44.884
who have been killed by this horrific

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:46.886
act of gun violence.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:48.321
That's really heartbreaking.

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:50.056
We see in this new video, Mayor,

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:50.890
the moment

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.025
that police officer Nick

00:04:52.025 --> 00:04:53.926
Wilt arrived on the scene,

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.461
the situation as he was shot

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.429
by the gunman.

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:57.263
Do you have any update,

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.965
first of all, on his condition tonight?

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:02.702
he has made

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:03.903
some positive progress,

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:06.005
but he is still in critical condition.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.707
And so the doctors have advised

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:08.608
us and his family

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:09.709
that they're coming

00:05:09.709 --> 00:05:12.011
hours and days are absolutely critical

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:14.881
given the shot to the head that he took.

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:16.849
And so we continue to support

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:18.051
and pray for him,

00:05:18.051 --> 00:05:18.851
his recovery,

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.186
as well as the other victims

00:05:20.186 --> 00:05:21.721
who do have some injuries.

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:23.056
And we're here as a community

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:23.589
to support

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:24.390
those families

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.993
who have lost loved ones as well.

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:28.761
So I don't have an exact update,

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:30.096
but we'll continue to provide updates

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.064
as we get them.

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:32.432
But we're just praying for positive.

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:34.233
Good news for Officer Wilson.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:35.568
How is your community,

00:05:35.568 --> 00:05:36.936
the Louisville community, mayor,

00:05:36.936 --> 00:05:39.105
reacting to seeing this video

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.573
of how all this unfolded,

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:43.142
especially when so many, including you,

00:05:43.242 --> 00:05:45.411
actually lost personal friends

00:05:45.411 --> 00:05:46.245
in this killing?

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:49.982
Yeah, I

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.117
think first and foremost,

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:53.753
our city is is heartbroken, heartbroken.

00:05:53.753 --> 00:05:54.721
Four,

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:59.325
five more lives lost due to gun violence.

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:00.393
And whether

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:00.960
like me,

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.195
you do someone

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:02.862
and we're close

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:04.297
friends or family

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:06.032
with someone who was killed

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:07.033
or whether you're just

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.735
part of our community,

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:12.338
These five victims should not be dead.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:14.407
Just like everyone else

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.142
who is killed by gun violence

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:18.010
in our city, in our country,

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.312
should not be dead.

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:20.580
And so while there is

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.281
a spirit of compassion

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:23.883
and a spirit of coming together

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:24.984
and we are going to unite

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:26.185
as a community stronger

00:06:26.185 --> 00:06:27.987
than other and shared love and support

00:06:27.987 --> 00:06:29.322
for one another.

00:06:29.322 --> 00:06:30.390
I'm also hopeful

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.924
that we are taking action

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:34.594
because as you heard from the doctor

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:35.862
at the University of Louisville

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:38.297
Hospital earlier on, in your package,

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:40.533
we are weary. We are tired.

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:42.101
We have had enough gun

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:43.336
violence in Louisville.

00:06:43.336 --> 00:06:44.570
We have had enough gun

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.139
violence in our country.

00:06:46.139 --> 00:06:48.241
And it is time to take action.

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.142
And so, as mayor,

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:50.343
I know I will be working

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:51.744
with elected officials,

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:53.012
with members of the public,

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.447
with clergy, with anyone

00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:56.349
who wants to be a part of the solution.

00:06:56.349 --> 00:06:56.783
To take

00:06:56.783 --> 00:06:57.750
whatever actions

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.217
we can

00:06:58.217 --> 00:07:00.286
to encourage our state legislators

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:02.488
to take action to give us more tools

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:03.990
to end gun violence.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.858
Because I know, Mayor, you're calling for

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:06.526
what's called

00:07:06.526 --> 00:07:08.528
local autonomy, for your city,

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:09.595
for Louisville

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:11.264
to take action on gun control,

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:12.432
among other measures.

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:13.499
What are the chances

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:15.301
Kentucky state lawmakers

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:17.170
will actually heed your call?

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:21.374
I am hopeful.

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:21.941
I'm hopeful

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:23.342
that with all of the tragedies

00:07:23.342 --> 00:07:25.111
we have had across the country

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:25.812
and right here

00:07:25.812 --> 00:07:27.647
now, again in our backyard,

00:07:27.647 --> 00:07:29.882
that people on all sides of the aisle

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:31.284
are willing to talk

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:32.952
and willing to take action.

00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:35.721
I have heard from lawmakers on both sides

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:38.658
of the aisle in our state capitol today

00:07:38.925 --> 00:07:40.126
I've had conversations

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:40.927
with several of them,

00:07:40.927 --> 00:07:42.595
preliminary conversation.

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:43.596
And we are going to be meeting

00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:44.363
in the coming days

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:46.365
to talk about what we can do together.

00:07:46.365 --> 00:07:47.834
This is not about Finger-Pointing.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:48.901
This isn't about blame.

00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:50.436
This isn't about politics.

00:07:50.436 --> 00:07:52.672
This is about life and death.

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:53.973
And so right now,

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:55.141
I am optimistic

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:55.842
and hopeful

00:07:55.842 --> 00:07:56.943
that we can come together

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.478
to make progress.

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.179
Mayor Craig Greenburg,

00:08:00.179 --> 00:08:01.547
thanks very much for joining us.

